Package: fastASSETcli
Type: Package
Title: Reference-Aligned FastASSET Command-Line Pipeline
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Jibin", "John", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "69025183+JIBINJOHNV@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Runs a reference-aligned fastASSET workflow for large collections
    of quantitative traits. It can load a separately saved GenomicSEM LDSC
    object or generate one from a validated summary-statistic manifest
    containing tabular or GWAS-VCF inputs. The workflow restores and audits
    trait labels, reorders the intercept covariance matrix,
    normalizes it to a trait correlation matrix, performs directional fastASSET
    subset testing, writes the ASSET fixed-effect Meta component, and records
    severity-ranked quality control.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
