Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/JIBINJOHNV/fastASSETcli,
    https://github.com/gqi/fastASSET
BugReports: https://github.com/JIBINJOHNV/fastASSETcli/issues
SystemRequirements: gzip; bcftools (for VCF/BCF manifest inputs only);
    fork-based parallelism requires Linux or macOS
